      "locator": {
        "clause": "一",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "凡依法可以使用外汇结算的跨境交易，企业都可以使用人民币结算。银行应以服务实体经济、促进贸易投资便利化为导向，根据跨境人民币政策，创新人民币金融产品，提升金融服务能力，充分满足客户真实、合规的人民币跨境业务需求。",
      "quoteHash": "355470e6ce9b445a08f127f5f1e480bb6c54b0245cc4ec57a49d950685ac7f94",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "bb4365f45979f88abc42102d80e28e811d1c9562ede0962000e34108f4794f8b",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB001-20260922-bb4365f4",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB001-b30a763d",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB001-0002",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "二",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行可在“了解你的客户”、“了解你的业务”、“尽职审查”三原则基础上，为个人办理其他经常项目人民币跨境结算业务。",
      "quoteHash": "b30a763dcd0fc8d997550123cbbd09c9faed9d52d71629550d8664994685ed54",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "bb4365f45979f88abc42102d80e28e811d1c9562ede0962000e34108f4794f8b",
      "sourceId": "REG-CB-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CB-001.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCB001-20260922-bb4365f4",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCB001-9ced501c",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCB001-0003",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "三",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "境外机构按照国务院碳交易主管部门相关规定，通过境内碳排放权交易机构以人民币开展碳排放权交易的，应按照《境外机构人民币银行结算账户管理办法》（银发〔2010〕249号文印发）和《中国人民银行关于境外机构人民币银行结算账户开立和使用有关问题的通知》（银发〔2012〕183号）等规定，在银行开立境外机构碳交易人民币专用存款账户，办理碳排放权交易项下资金收付。",
      "quoteHash": "9ced501c64a94a343007f08f0ed477d3dabefa32837b69bfe8bb105c2887b5e2",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "bb4365f45979f88abc42102d80e28e811d1c9562ede0962000e34108f4794f8b",
